---
import GreenfieldLayout from '../../layouts/GreenfieldLayout.astro';
---

<GreenfieldLayout title="COBOGÓ — Core">
  <main id="conteudo" class="gf-section">
    <p class="gf-kicker">Referência · contrato público</p>
    <h1>Core</h1>
    <p>O core define papéis semânticos, relações espaciais, tipografia, foco, estados e motion sem escolher a identidade do produto.</p>
    <section data-cobogo-pause aria-labelledby="entrypoints-title">
      <h2 id="entrypoints-title">Entrypoints</h2>
      <pre class="gf-code-block" tabindex="0" aria-label="Entrypoints do Cobogó"><code>import 'cobogo/core';
import 'cobogo/patterns'; // experimental, quando aplicável</code></pre>
    </section>
    <section data-cobogo-pause aria-labelledby="roles-title">
      <h2 id="roles-title">Papéis semânticos</h2>
      <div class="gf-reference-list">
        <article class="gf-reference-row"><div><span class="gf-inscription">color</span><h3>canvas · surface · text · accent · focus</h3></div><code>--cobogo-*</code></article>
        <article class="gf-reference-row"><div><span class="gf-inscription">type</span><h3>body · display · inscription · data</h3></div><code>--cobogo-font-*</code></article>
        <article class="gf-reference-row"><div><span class="gf-inscription">space</span><h3>adjacent · group · section · pause</h3></div><code>--cobogo-space-*</code></article>
        <article class="gf-reference-row"><div><span class="gf-inscription">state</span><h3>info · success · warning · danger</h3></div><code>data-cobogo-state</code></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section data-cobogo-pause aria-labelledby="theme-title"><h2 id="theme-title">Tema local é downstream</h2><p>Este site usa papel quente e azul-marinho; outros consumers mantêm valores próprios sem alterar o significado dos papéis.</p></section>
    <p><a href="/cobogo/">← voltar à orientação</a></p>
  </main>
</GreenfieldLayout>
